+# Plan
+
+## Constraints
+- Pure domain code: no IO, clock or randomness; deterministic output.
+- Do not modify existing modules or the bundle format; reuse `BlockRecord`,
+  `SectionRecord`, `DocumentRecord`, `KnowledgeBundle`, `bundle_digest`.
+- Python typed, ruff-clean style as in the repo. Tests first, seen failing.
+- Every task leaves the suite green.
+
+## Task 1 — splitting
+- Files: create `backend/src/pharma_agent/domain/corpus/authoring.py`; test `backend/tests/domain/corpus/test_authoring.py`.
+- Provides: `Section`, `split_markdown`.
+- Test: sections/paths/ordinals, fenced headings ignored, fallback heading, empty sections dropped, table runs `t1..tn` document-wide, stripped prose.
+
+## Task 2 — slugs and keys
+- Files: modify `authoring.py`; same test file.
+- Provides: `slugify`, `section_key`, `bundle_document_key`.
+- Test: `Đường uống`→`duong-uong`, max_length, `doc#a/b`, `doc#body`.
+
+## Task 3 — choices and bundle
+- Files: modify `authoring.py`; same test file.
+- Uses: Tasks 1–2. Provides: `AuthoredDocument`, `section_choices`, `build_bundle`.
+- Test: choices order/labels, bundle counts/sorting/manifest, colloquial filtering, duplicate heading keys, same digest regardless of input order, `write_bundle` accepts it.
